<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.6000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.6000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.6000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.7100 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Feb 26		  Feb 25</p>
<p> High			     75.5000		 75.6020</p>
<p> Low				75.6500		 75.7199</p>
<p> Open			     75.6179		 75.7000</p>
<p> Close			    75.6000		 75.7100</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  3.925		   3.220</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Feb 26		  Feb 25</p>
<p> High			     44.5500		 45.4500</p>
<p> Low				44.5500		 45.5300</p>
<p> Open			     44.5500		 45.5300</p>
<p> Close			    44.5500		 45.4500</p>
<p> Volume (DM million)		 0.010		   0.055</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
